SUMMARY:Map Mania
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Robyn Hall\n\nMap Mania\nSessions for basic PAPER map r
 eading and compass skills.\nAbsolutely all welcome. You don't have to have 
 attended previous sessions to join us. \nMeet in the car park just outside 
 the 30 limit of Welland. ///ascendant.dislikes.throat\nWe will cover up to 
 7km very gently\, likely less\, as the main focus is on the map reading.\nA
 pproximately 2 hours (longer if you get us lost 😉)\nIf you need reading 
 glasses\, please bring them. \nAlso wear appropriate layers for stop/starti
 ng. \n\n\nView on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/
